  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Luo Po Valley, Fairy Jiang Yu waves her sleeves and countless Gu worms fly up from the valley. Using an immense number of white lotus giant silkworm Gu as the foundation, they form a super Gu formation, and when it ends tens of Gu worms, many of them Immortal Gu, fly back into Qin Bai Sheng’s immortal aperture and his full strength returns.",
      "chapters": [
        771
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "gu_white_lotus_giant_silkworm_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan notes that the super Gu formations Shadow Sect had in all five regions used a method of setting up formations with large numbers of self will Gu as the core, mainly to seal heaven’s will. One of Shadow Sect’s first split souls, Green, had researched the life-and-death immortal aperture in Earth Trench’s super Gu formation when a huge explosion occurred during that research.",
      "chapters": [
        1095
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sealing-heavens-will",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "gu_self_will_gu",
        "char_green",
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A pillar of light bursts into the sky, the super Gu formation over the giant dream realm conceals itself and vanishes from the watching immortals’ sight, and the old Gu Immortal who set it up descends to say the work is finally done. The righteous path Gu Immortals then fall to arguing over shares of the dream realm by contribution, Wu clan counting the five Immortal Gu it put in, Luo tribe claiming as many, and a voice for a third clan answering that its own first supreme elder, Chi Qu You, was the man chiefly in charge of setting the formation up.",
      "chapters": [
        1111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-finished-over-the-giant-dream-realm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "fac_luo_tribe",
        "char_chi_qu_you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The super Gu formation concealing the giant dream realm was arranged by Chi clan’s first supreme elder, Chi Qu You, a formation path great grandmaster. Southern Border’s righteous path has thirteen super forces, and each sent at least one Gu Immortal to defend the formation, which was made through all of their efforts.",
      "chapters": [
        1212
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "who-arranged-it",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_chi_clan",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hair Mistress states that Old Ancestor Xue Hu invited Sun Ming Lu to arrange a super Gu formation over Snowy Mountain blessed land. With the snowy peak lords as the formation cores, it links to Reverse Flow River. Invaders have to charge through each peak; peak lords receive amplification so rank six cultivation can display rank seven strength, while the charging Gu Immortal is greatly suppressed. Even rank eight Gu Immortals must spend time there unless they can destroy the formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1250
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "snowy-mountain-case",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hair_mistress",
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu",
        "char_sun_ming_lu",
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "loc_reverse_flow_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhao Lian Yun judges that it is almost impossible to break this formation, and that even a rank eight Gu Immortal will be trapped and unable to extricate themselves. Although there are no rank eight Immortal Gu used in this super Gu formation, it perfectly utilizes Reverse Flow River and displays endless might. The formation completely remodels Snowy Mountain blessed land, using the fifteen snowy peaks as the formation cores to form a solid defense.",
      "chapters": [
        1252
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reverse-flow-river-core",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "sys_immortal_will"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the giant dream realm, Ba clan is leading Gu Immortals in giving Wu clan trouble, and rising pressure at the super Gu formation there leads Wu Yong to stall sending Fang Yuan to it rather than change people at that moment.",
      "chapters": [
        1305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pressure-at-the-giant-dream-realm-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_giant_dream_realm",
        "fac_ba_clan",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Still posing as Wu Yi Hai and still wanting to reach that super Gu formation, Fang Yuan has to accept Xia Fei Kuai’s spar challenge, even though he cares nothing for Wu clan’s reputation or glory.",
      "chapters": [
        1309
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reason-fang-yuan-accepts-a-spar",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yi_hai",
        "char_xia_fei_kuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The dream realm business’s super Gu formation uses Immortal Gu that belong to Southern Border’s super clans, but Chi clan’s first supreme elder personally set the formation up. Chi clan contributes few of its own Immortal Gu to it, yet holds enormous influence over it, so Wu clan has to bring Chi clan into the dream realm business or the business cannot go forward.",
      "chapters": [
        1329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "whose-formation-it-is",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
